CPU or RAM Overloaded?

Your server is slow and unresponsive? Time to check which processes are hogging resources.

Try these commands:

`top -o %CPU` — Sorts processes by CPU usage

`top -o %MEM` — Sorts processes by RAM usage
 
`htop` — A colorful, interactive view showing CPU and memory per process

Look for anything unusually high in %CPU or %MEM. These are your suspects!
